      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burchinal%2C_Iowa"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Burchinal takes its name from T. Burchinal and his wife, early promoters who helped shape the area’s settlement.",
